\v 33 son of \zwd Shammah \f + \fr 23:33 \ft Some LXX manuscripts (see also 1 Chronicles 11:34); Hebrew Jonathan, 33 Shammah\f* the Hararite|\zwd*, 
\b
\li1 \zwd Ahiam son of \zwd Sharar \f + \fr 23:33 \ft Hebrew; some LXX manuscripts Sachar; see 1 Chronicles 11:35.\f* the Hararite|id="Q140288237" t="2"\zwd*|Q65302941\zwd*, 
\b
